  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ef3043b17d54949e7a434fc7c69b7249, type: 3}
  m_Name: Rafi_Lines
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcLines
  nameColor: {r: 0.45, g: 0.75, b: 1, a: 1}
  voicePitch: 0.75
  greeting: Ah, a new face on the docks! Name's Rafi. Grab a rod and I'll show you how it's done.
  lines:
  - Hold the left mouse button to pull your rod back. The longer you hold, the further you cast.
  - Let go and the line flies. Click again to reel it back in.
  - Patience is half of fishing. The other half is not falling in.
  - Catch me a fish over 2 kilos and I'll know you're the real deal.
  - Thirty years on this water and the sea still surprises me.
